                    },
                    "message": "Set And Verify DHCPv6 Property this keyword only checks if the DHCPv6 is enabled/ disabled and doesn't have the check for checking if the IPv6 addresses list has the DHCPv6 address coming up or not, hence keeping the same."
                },
                {
