                        "email": "Megha.G.N@ibm.com",
                        "username": "meghagn5"
                    },
                    "message": "${resp}=  Redfish.Get  ${REDFISH_NW_ETH_IFACE}${ethernet_interface}\n    ${dhcpv6_verify}=  Get From Dictionary  ${resp.dict}  DHCPv6\n\n    Should Be Equal  '${dhcpv6_verify['OperatingMode']}'  '${dhcpv6_operating_mode}'\n  in the above however you are fetching DHCPv6 address field right so in the same \n  \"Verify DHCPv6 Property\" keyword you can add below verification part just by passing channel_number, so that it will be useful for other TCs as well.....It's a suggestion"
